CORE
main.cpp
--cpp20
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line 28 array lvalue binds forwarding ref of constrained friend: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
A hidden friend function TEMPLATE of a class template uses the
injected-class-name as a parameter type and a constrained forwarding
reference for the piped operand (the libc++ range-adaptor
`operator|` shape, N5008 [temp.friend]/1, [temp.local]/1,
[temp.deduct.call]/2-3).  The friend must remain callable after
hoisting to namespace scope, with the bare class name denoting the
defining instantiation.
